    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d143">

                <pb facs="0248" n="164" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg164"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Beaupré.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-07-13"><hi rendition="#italic">July 13,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Neither of the proposed amendments mentioned in your telegram<anchor n="a"
                        xml:id="d143-f1"/> received to-day would stand any chance of acceptance by
                    the Senate of the United States, while any amendment whatever or unnecessary
                    delay in the ratification of the treaty would greatly imperil its
                    consummation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
